{"translation-revision-date":"2023-10-17 14:31:16+0000","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"src\/AgentX\/chat\/plugin-nudges.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"hu","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;"},"Update my phone number":["Friss\u00edtsd a telefonsz\u00e1momat"],"Set up my store":["\u00c1ll\u00edtsd be a boltomat"],"Show me what you can do":["Mutasd meg, mire vagy k\u00e9pes"],"By the way, I think this needs your attention.":["Egy\u00e9bk\u00e9nt szerintem ez figyelmet \u00e9rdemel."],"Do you want to set up your store?":["Be\u00e1ll\u00edtjuk a boltodat?"],"Your store isn\u2019t set up yet. Want to set it up now?":["A boltod m\u00e9g nincs be\u00e1ll\u00edtva. Be\u00e1ll\u00edtsuk most?"],"Set up store":["Bolt be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Do you want to update your phone number next?":["Friss\u00edtj\u00fck most a telefonsz\u00e1modat?"],"Update phone number":["Telefonsz\u00e1m friss\u00edt\u00e9se"],"There\u2019s more I can help you with.":["M\u00e1sban is tudok seg\u00edteni."],"Do you want to see what I can do next?":["Megn\u00e9zed, mire vagyok m\u00e9g k\u00e9pes?"],"You\u2019ve finished setting up your website.":["Befejezted a webhelyed be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t."],"You\u2019ve finished setting up your website. If you need anything, just let me know.":["Befejezted a webhelyed be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t. Ha b\u00e1rmire sz\u00fcks\u00e9ged van, csak sz\u00f3lj."],"Next we should focus on setting up WooCommerce.":["K\u00f6vetkez\u0151 l\u00e9p\u00e9sk\u00e9nt a WooCommerce be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1ra \u00e9rdemes figyeln\u00fcnk."],"You\u2019ve finished setting up your store.":["Befejezted a boltod be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t."],"You\u2019ve finished setting up your store. If you need anything, just let me know.":["Befejezted a boltod be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t. Ha b\u00e1rmire sz\u00fcks\u00e9ged van, csak sz\u00f3lj."],"Do you want to optimize your images next?":["Optimaliz\u00e1ljuk most a k\u00e9peidet?"],"Imagify is ready now. Want me to optimize the images already on your site?":["Az Imagify k\u00e9szen \u00e1ll. Optimaliz\u00e1ljam a webhelyeden m\u00e1r fent l\u00e9v\u0151 k\u00e9peket?"],"Optimize my images":["Optimaliz\u00e1ld a k\u00e9peimet"],"Optimize images":["K\u00e9pek optimaliz\u00e1l\u00e1sa"],"Add API key":["API-kulcs hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Do you want to add your Imagify API key next?":["Hozz\u00e1adod most az Imagify API-kulcsodat?"],"See plans":["Csomagok megtekint\u00e9se"],"Do you want to see Imagify\u2019s plans?":["Megn\u00e9zed az Imagify csomagjait?"]}}}